    Write the text data file equivalent to FILE LNLISD (PBB) / LNLISX (PIBB).
    PUT @001 BRANCH 3. @004 ACCTNO 10. @014 NOTENO 5.
        @020 APPRLIMT COMMA15.2 @040 BALANCE COMMA15.2
    Fixed record length 80.

    PBB : IF BALANCE > 0 OR APPRLIMT > 0; missing BALANCE/APPRLIMT set to 0.
    PIBB: every row is written; no filter and no missing-to-0 step in the original
          (missing values print as '.').
